<Base title="Privacy — Muhammad Irfan Waseem" description="Learn how the portfolio handles theme preferences, hosting logs and contact form submissions."><header class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy.</h1></header><article class="wrap page-body prose"><h2>Browsing this portfolio</h2><p>This static portfolio does not include advertising or analytics trackers. Your selected light or dark theme is stored in your browser’s local storage. The hosting provider may keep standard request logs.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>The contact form sends your name, email address and message to Formspree so that your enquiry can be delivered. Do not include passwords, payment information or other sensitive details.</p><p>Formspree processes submissions under its <a class="text-link" href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>. Messages are used to respond to your enquiry. To request deletion of a message, contact <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>GitHub, LinkedIn and linked project sites operate under their own privacy policies. Downloads are initiated only when you choose a download link.</p></article></Base>
